<title>USA: Republic Industries drops suit vs Toyota.</title>
<headline>Republic Industries drops suit vs Toyota.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Republic Industries Inc said Wednesday it has voluntarily withdrawn a lawsuit against Toyota Motor Sales USA and it will drop a counterclaim against the Toyota Motor Corp unit it had brought before the Texas Motor Vehicle Board.</p>
<p>Republic, a diversified holding company, said it was withdrawing the actions because recently amended franchise law in Texas achieves the same objective it was seeking through legal channels.</p>
</text>
